// HZM coop [aircraft 2026-10-05] aircraft call-in sounds (coop_mod/aircraft.scr). Retail wavs only.
// Same rules as coop_explosions.scr: every line carries BOTH always and a maps list (a lazily registered
// sound arriving after the gamestate is the bug-1183 disconnect), and the list is a prefix match.

// C-47 pass over the drop zone: retail plane-by, pitched down for a heavy twin (baked Doppler; the cgame adds
// the live shift on the engine loop).
aliascache coop_c47_flyby          sound/vehicle/M1_PlaneBy.wav                 soundparms 1.8 0.1 0.72 0.04 3000 14000 weapon streamed always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
// a shootable plane taking hits / going down (retail Stuka impact set)
aliascache coop_ac_sputter         sound/weapons/impact/Stuka_impact02.wav      soundparms 1.6 0.2 0.9 0.15 1500 9000 weapon loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
// class D maps (no sky): heavy flak heard through the roof while the plane passes unseen
aliascache coop_ac_flak           sound/weapons/Fire/flak_exp.wav               soundparms 1.4 0.3 0.8 0.2 2500 12000 weapon loaded always maps "m e t dm obj lib train"
